d configurable fish shoal system.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/956480/extras/30229425d7bf2b4fc563b6bff83595da.avif?t=1553819435\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And more...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>70+ fishes(WIP)<br></li><li>20+ foods<br></li><li>2D backgrounds<br></li><li>Plants<br></li><li>Decoration objects<br></li><li>Swimming toys</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plan</h2>Workshop: Share backgrounds(1920x1080), fishes, decorations, routes, and all other configurable objects through Workshop.",
